Package: bastillaos-system
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: BastillaOS
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Depends: coreutils (>= 9.3), git, nodejs (>= 20), python3, systemd, tar
Description: Local SVL System panel and applications
 SVL System local web panel, packaged with its production server bundle,
 generated frontend, default applications, and persistent writable state.
 Includes the without_nlp deterministic Euler & Fourier harmonic engine as
 the system command /usr/bin/without-nlp.
